@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title DELETE external account: account-scoped unlink

autonumber
actor "客户端" as Client
participant "REST / RestAlchemy controller" as API
database "Account / mappings / work / access / canonical union" as DB
database "Object storage" as Storage
database "Ready public events" as Events
participant "WebSocket dispatcher" as WS

Client -> API : DELETE current account route
API -> DB : lock account; revoke lease generation
API -> DB : delete credential + account work/assignments
API -> DB : unlink verified owner + remove account-derived access
API -> DB : retain shared MESSAGE/TOPIC/STREAM/file rows
API -> Storage : delete blob only if zero remaining references
API -> DB : immutable external_account.deleted outbox
API --> Client : 204 No Content
DB -> Events : deleted projection/event atomically
WS -> Events : replay/live

note over API,Storage
  Public route/status unchanged.
  Other connected/native references keep canonical rows and blobs.
  Cleanup retry is idempotent; credentials never enter events.
end note
@enduml
